    "sections": {
        "description": "Drone Services is a bright, field ready block theme for agricultural drone operators, aerial survey crews, crop spraying contractors and precision farming consultancies. A full bleed hero over a blue sky veil carries the navigation, a headline with a gradient accent, floating live status chips, a feature card and a trust row of client faces, and the page below runs on soft white and sky washes with rounded cards, blue gradient buttons and a deep navy footer. Ready made patterns cover a six card services grid with line icons and spec lines, a two column FAQ with an expandable question list and a dispatch phone button, a field notes query loop, and navy banners for pages, posts, archives and search. Full site editing puts every colour, gradient, font size and spacing step in the editor, the palette runs from sky and blue to leaf green and navy, and the typography pairs Plus Jakarta Sans headlines with Inter body text. The theme is fully responsive from wide desktop down to small phones, supports right to left languages, is translation ready and keeps markup accessible with visible focus outlines and reduced motion support."
    },
